      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِرْضَحَةٌ</span></b>  The <i>thing with which date-stones are
broken,</i> or <i>bruised, brayed,</i> or <i>crushed, to serve as
provender</i> [<i>for camels</i>]. (R, TA.) [See also
what next follows.]

